{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 44,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        51.5809440612793,
        302.948486328125,
        82.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "8.\t Research priorities",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.95880126953125,
        526.6873168945312,
        180.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "The review of the evidence for the recommendations exposed gaps in research that should be filled urgently,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.95880126953125,
        370.467041015625,
        194.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "in addition to those identified during preparation of the 2015 guidelines.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.917724609375,
        455.63885498046875,
        226.7007293701172
      ],
      "text": "8.1\t Risks of at-risk populations for progression to active TB disease",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.63604736328125,
        526.7072143554688,
        245.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "Evidence on the risks of a number of at-risk populations for progression from LTBI to active disease will be",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.63604736328125,
        526.7103881835938,
        259.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "crucial for determining the potential benefits of LTBI treatment and for designing appropriate public health",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.63604736328125,
        526.7211303710938,
        273.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "interventions. In particular, strong evidence from clinical trials is lacking for the following groups: patients with",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.63604736328125,
        526.697265625,
        287.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "diabetes, people with harmful use of alcohol, tobacco smokers, underweight people, people exposed to silica,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.63604736328125,
        526.7081909179688,
        301.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "patients receiving steroid treatment, patients with rheumatological conditions, indigenous populations and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.63604736328125,
        526.6982421875,
        315.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "cancer patients. Both direct measurement of the incidence of active TB and methods for measuring the risk for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        316.63604736328125,
        483.50421142578125,
        329.43603515625
      ],
      "text": "active TB disease could be explored, such as use of genotyping to measure the risk for reactivation.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.3060607910156,
        526.72021484375,
        349.1060485839844
      ],
      "text": "Evidence is also required on differential harm and the acceptability of testing and treatment for LTBI in specific",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.3060607910156,
        354.60906982421875,
        363.1060485839844
      ],
      "text": "risk groups, including socially adverse events such as stigmatization.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.26422119140625,
        383.03900146484375,
        395.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "8.2\t Defining the best algorithm for ruling out active TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.9825134277344,
        526.6451416015625,
        413.7825012207031
      ],
      "text": "Operational and clinical studies should be conducted to exclude active TB before preventive treatment is",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.9825134277344,
        526.7251586914062,
        427.7825012207031
      ],
      "text": "given. The performance and feasibility of the algorithms proposed in these guidelines should be assessed.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.9825134277344,
        526.6633911132812,
        441.7825012207031
      ],
      "text": "In particular, few data are available on children and pregnant women. Strategies to save cost and improve",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.9825134277344,
        372.9451904296875,
        455.7825012207031
      ],
      "text": "feasibility (e.g. use of mobile chest radiography) should also be explored.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.9413146972656,
        468.7961730957031,
        487.7243347167969
      ],
      "text": "8.3\t Improved diagnostic tests and performance of LTBI tests in at-risk",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88710021972656,
        484.94232177734375,
        169.68948364257812,
        501.725341796875
      ],
      "text": "populations",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.65960693359375,
        526.7151489257812,
        520.4595947265625
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic tests with improved performance and predictive value for reactivation of TB are critically needed. In",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.6596069335938,
        526.6922607421875,
        534.4595947265625
      ],
      "text": "addition, the performance of LTBI tests should be evaluated in various at-risk populations, such as the best way",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.6596069335938,
        517.21240234375,
        548.4595947265625
      ],
      "text": "of using the available tools (e.g. combination or sequential use of TST and IGRA) in each at-risk population.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.6184692382812,
        254.91360473632812,
        580.4014892578125
      ],
      "text": "8.4\t Treatment options for LTBI",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.3367919921875,
        526.6563110351562,
        599.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "Research to find shorter, better-tolerated treatment regimens than those currently recommended is a priority.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.3367919921875,
        526.6923217773438,
        613.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "Studies of efficacy and adverse events in certain risk groups (e.g. people who use drugs, people with alcohol",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.3367919921875,
        526.599365234375,
        627.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "use disorder and elderly people) are essential. In particular, there are no or very limited data on the use of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.3367919921875,
        526.6372680664062,
        641.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "rifapentine in children < 2 years and pregnant women. Studies should be conducted of the pharmacokinetics",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.3367919921875,
        526.6673583984375,
        655.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "of interactions between rifamycin-containing regimens and other drugs, particularly antiretroviral drugs. In",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.3367919921875,
        526.6202392578125,
        669.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "addition, the durability of protection by preventive treatment should be evaluated in settings in which TB is",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.3367919921875,
        389.4891357421875,
        683.1367797851562
      ],
      "text": "endemic, including the efficacy of repeated courses of preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.2955932617188,
        265.3695068359375,
        715.07861328125
      ],
      "text": "8.5\t Monitoring of adverse events",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.0140380859375,
        526.7013549804688,
        733.8140258789062
      ],
      "text": "Prospective randomized studies are required to determine the incremental benefits of routine monitoring of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.0140380859375,
        526.6362915039062,
        747.8140258789062
      ],
      "text": "liver enzyme levels over education and clinical observation alone for preventing severe clinical adverse events,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.0140380859375,
        302.01513671875,
        761.8140258789062
      ],
      "text": "with stratification of the evidence by at-risk population.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.93629837036133,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.688297271728516,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "32",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}